  pattern, a single design, not the entire line"). One motif from the page's own pattern rows,
  drawn large in fine gold lines (non-scaling 1px strokes) to fill an empty space: it draws itself
  once on arrival, then turns very slowly (assets/hoa-about.js + hoa-about.css .hoa-ab-motif).
  Decorative only. Without JS or with reduced motion it is simply there, still.

